# Rust / Cargo build output.
# NOT anchored with a leading slash: there are several crates in this repo
# (root, rp2040/) and each grows its own target/. A leading slash would only
# match the root one and silently let the others be committed.
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Intermediate flashing artifact (regenerated by objcopy from the ELF).
# The final *.uf2 files ARE tracked — they're the deliverable.
*.bin

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. This is a binary crate and the
# build must be reproducible offline against pinned versions.

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Google Drive sync cruft
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
Icon?
